{"id":"u-ce26ba52-9d12-492a-979a-42f43c17589f","src":"community","title":"Reta Recomp","author":"Tumacti Jun","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/nTM6G1-reta-recomp","desc":"Reta Recomp is a 12-week, science backed \ntraining program built for individuals focused on maximizing muscle growth, strength, and body recomposition.\n\nBuilt using principles from respected evidence-based coaches and the latest hypertrophy research—not social media trends or random workout splits.\n\nThis program wasn’t thrown together from random exercises. It was developed after weeks of researching evidence-based hypertrophy principles from multiple respected coaches, exercise scientists, and well-established training methodologies. Every exercise, set, rep range, and workout order was intentionally selected based on current research and practical experience to optimize muscle stimulus, manage fatigue, and maximize progressive overload.\n\nOver 48 structured workouts, you’ll train every major muscle group with an emphasis on balanced development, efficient exercise sequencing, and long-term progression. Each session has a purpose, ensuring no exercise is included without a reason.\n\nDesigned for intermediate to advanced lifters with access to a full gym, Reta Recomp provides a structured roadmap to help you train smarter—not just harder. If you’re ready to follow a program built on proven training principles instead of guesswork, this is the program for you.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-24T00:32:48.261Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Re